\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,K,+_V,\\odot,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\">\\(\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,K,+_V,\\odot,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,V,V,K,+_V,\\odot,+_V,\\odot)\">\\(\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,V,V,K,+_V,\\odot,+_V,\\odot)\\)</span> are the exact source signatures.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFuncEigenvalue}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFuncEigenvalue}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}func\\text{-}eigenvalue} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFuncEigenvalue}_S(\\lambda,T,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,V,+_V,0_V,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,K,+_V,\\odot,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,V,V,K,+_V,\\odot,+_V,\\odot)\\land0_V\\in V\\land\\forall v\\in V\\;(+_V(\\langle0_V,v\\rangle)=v)\\land\\lambda\\in K\\land\\exists x\\in V\\setminus\\{0_V\\}\\;\\bigl(T(x)=\\odot(\\langle\\lambda,x\\rangle)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}func\\text{-}eigenvalue} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFuncEigenvalue}_S(\\lambda,T,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,V,+_V,0_V,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,K,+_V,\\odot,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,V,V,K,+_V,\\odot,+_V,\\odot)\\land0_V\\in V\\land\\forall v\\in V\\;(+_V(\\langle0_V,v\\rangle)=v)\\land\\lambda\\in K\\land\\exists x\\in V\\setminus\\{0_V\\}\\;\\bigl(T(x)=\\odot(\\langle\\lambda,x\\rangle)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The source vector-space argument order and scalar-action application are preserved exactly; <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0_V\">\\(0_V\\)</span> is explicitly tied to the additive operation.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-field","status":"resolved","id":"1eb4a89b005d9cda","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-field]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-vector-space","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-vector-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"f67456d74b418241","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-linear-map.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,V,+_V,0_V,\\odot,T,\\lambda\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,K,+_V,\\odot,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,V,V,K,+_V,\\odot,+_V,\\odot)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcFuncEigenvalue}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}func\\text{-}eigenvalue} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcFuncEigenvalue}_S(\\lambda,T,K,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K,V,+_V,0_V,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{VectorSpace}_S(V,K,+_V,\\odot,+_K,\\cdot_K,0_K,1_K)\\land\\mathrm{LinearMap}_S(T,V,V,K,+_V,\\odot,+_V,\\odot)\\land0_V\\in V\\land\\forall v\\in V\\;(+_V(\\langle0_V,v\\rangle)=v)\\land\\lambda\\in K\\land\\exists x\\in V\\setminus\\{0_V\\}\\;\\bigl(T(x)=\\odot(\\langle\\lambda,x\\rangle)\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"